# playpick: mode=raid boss=cold spec=mage:frost style=dodge size=25
# difficulty=heroic view=390x844,touch save=carried
#
# The Long Cold at 25-heroic is README's own hardest single cell, and
# direction.md's #1 ("doing nothing wins") has only ever measured it under a
# healer (restoration shaman, good vs idle, 2026-09-25) -- a role the fight is
# explicitly built around. Every other #1 reading of this boss was at
# 10-normal, its easiest setting (warrior:arms under flee and dodge). This
# cell crosses two axes at once for the first time: a ranged dps caster (every
# prior Long Cold role was a healer or a melee dps/tank) under dodge (a style
# with no toward-boss term at all, only away-from-danger, so it never presses
# an ability) at the hardest difficulty this boss has. carried is known
# fresh-in-disguise within one playbot invocation per #273 (still open), so
# the invite hash is what actually gets here, same as every prior Long Cold
# session -- README's own "Sharing" section: a fight link unlocks the boss it
# points at regardless of save state. Portrait touch (390x844) is also new for
# this boss: every prior touch reading of it was landscape (844x390).
open #b=cold&s=25&h=1
targets
tap class:mage:frost
tap pull
waitscreen fight 15
state
shot open

play dodge 90
bill
shot mid1
state

play dodge 90
bill
shot mid2
state

play dodge 90
bill
shot mid3
state
says
